2) core/executor/src/lib.rs:2739-2757 — stop committing state from aborted Move txs. In `absorb_vm_result!`, only drain `$vm_changes` into `updates` when `$status.success`; on abort keep the gas/fee/receipt updates and drop the VM changeset:
