(1) Seed the registry at genesis, alongside the existing PoolRegistry block in core/node/src/genesis.rs (~line 1139). BCS of an empty `vector<TokenInfo>` is a single 0x00 byte, exactly what the passing executor test hand-seeds:

    // === Initialize Token Factory Registry ===
