Add it to the `verify_genesis_integrity` decode list (genesis.rs:571-581) so a missing registry fails startup instead of silently eating fees, and bump GENESIS_VERSION. This only takes effect on a fresh datadir (`genesis_initialized` guard at genesis.rs:635) — the live 3-node testnet needs the same key written by a migration, or a fresh mainnet genesis.

(2) In core/vm_move/stdlib/sources/token_factory.move, move the registry borrow and the duplicate-token_id scan (lines 98-105) ABOVE the fee withdraw/burn (lines 86-87), so the call aborts before any state is touched. Because aborts are non-atomic here, "check before you charge" is the only safe ordering. Same reordering should be applied to dex.move:114.

Make the genesis pin authoritative, fail-closed, at boot — smallest change that covers all three consumers (executor, mempool, qc) without threading a storage handle into qc.rs.

In core/node/src/genesis.rs, right after the pin is read for the identity hash (genesis.rs:591, which already loads `sys:chain_id`), add:

let pinned = chain_id.trim();
if !pinned.is_empty() {
    match std::env::var("AINCORE_CHAIN_ID") {
        Ok(v) if v.trim() != pinned => {
            return Err(GenesisError::InvalidData(format!(
                "FATAL: AINCORE_CHAIN_ID={} does not match genesis-pinned sys:chain_id={}",
                v.trim(), pinned)));
        }
        Ok(_) => {}
        Err(_) => std::env::set_var("AINCORE_CHAIN_ID", pinned), // adopt the pin
    }
}

This must run before consensus/API/sync threads start so every later `env::var` read observes the pinned value. Effect: an unset env adopts the genesis chain id instead of silently assuming mainnet, and a contradicting env aborts the node rather than forking it.

Optional hardening (larger, not required): give Executor its own storage-first resolver mirroring dag.rs:1132-1155 (it already holds `self.db`, used at lib.rs:2449), cached in a OnceLock, and have mempool/lib.rs:182 call that instead of duplicating the inline env read. Also fix the inverted comment at executor/src/lib.rs:15.

